    <pubDate>Tue, 03 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h1><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MMAQzSEsn/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MMAQzSEsn/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click"><span>你以为在打工 其实在折寿的行为？这些身体最喜欢的动作，建议你多做【陈博闻×姜Dora】</span></a></h1><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk9519-mq5TdtTha6EOz6e3jLElq.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>📜前言</span></p><span></span><p><span>听说90%的打工人都有这种症状？一上班就浑身难受，一看到老板就难受。</span></p><span></span><p><span>职场人又不能打倒老板，又不能马上逃离工作环境，忍着忍着身体就会出问题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期采访的是陈博闻，前国家队康复师。我想问问他打工人如何保养自己？哪些健康隐患是经常被大家忽略的？</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你总是一上班就腰酸背痛、提不起劲，这期就是为你定制的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🧙 主播与嘉宾</span></p><span></span><p><span>姜Dora：知名职场博主，全网600万粉丝的内容创作者。</span></p><span></span><p><span>爱聊天的ENFP，致力于为职场中的年轻人提供精神力量和解决方案。</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈博闻：锐博康复创始人，曾担任CBA男篮及国家花样游泳队康复师</span></p><span></span><p><span>📜内容要点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="33">00:33</a> 开头引入</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="51">00:51</a> 一上班就难受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="181">03:01</a> 情绪储存在身体里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="284">04:44</a> 放松交感神经的方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="588">09:48</a> 鼠标手等常见办公室病</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="643">10:43</a> 肩背部疼痛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="709">11:49</a> 女性经期的身体疼痛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="807">13:27</a> 久坐身体僵硬发麻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="839">13:59</a> 坐姿调整</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="935">15:35</a> 常见的伤膝盖姿势</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1005">16:45</a> 熬夜的危害</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1065">17:45</a> 如何合理午休</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1104">18:24</a> 皮质醇过高</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1173">19:33</a> 通勤站姿调整</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1246">20:46</a> 疼痛有时是种信号</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1295">21:35</a> 身体是潜意识的表达</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️主播｜@姜dora在此</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️ 嘉宾｜@陈博闻</span></p><span></span><p><span>💼 制作人员监制：姜Dora</span></p><span></span><p><span>💼 后期制作：明明、小满</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎在以下平台关注我们：抖音 | B站 | 小红书｜视频号：@姜dora在此（全平台同名）</span></p>]]></description>
